  "rationale": "73 units of Wheat Bread 400G at Outlet 04 (South Bengaluru) are projected unsold before the expiry deadline on 2026-09-19; doing nothing writes off ₹4782 and a blanket 20% markdown costs ₹1947. This play uses a bundle with SKU-PANEER-400G at ₹140 for 329 consented customers (Personal care regulars, Tea connoisseurs, Everyday staples shoppers, Sweets occasionals, Premium Tea regulars, Household essentials buyers): expected 32 units, margin ₹428, discount cost ₹484, waste avoided ₹2115 (CI 2 to 94 units; prior n 20, measured n 0). Policy v1: \"2. Prefer bundles and transfers over blanket markdowns; markdowns are the last lever.\" This bundle play pairs Wheat Bread with Paneer 400G at a bundle price of 140 INR, which satisfies the 8.0% bakery margin floor. It targets all consented customers across segments to maximize reach and clear the expiry risk.",
